00:52:06.656 --> 00:52:11.294 align:start size:97% position:3%
And something I really
been thinking about is risk

00:52:11.294 --> 00:52:13.430
and then risk assessment.

00:52:13.430 --> 00:52:18.435 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I started to think about
all the guys I work with.

00:52:19.636 --> 00:52:21.905
And I work with a lot
of guys restoring cars

00:52:21.905 --> 00:52:24.908
