kind of blue collar.

00:52:29.346 --> 00:52:31.982
And I noticed that
the blue collar guys

00:52:31.982 --> 00:52:35.018 align:start size:97% position:3%
were always very even,
they're not worried about it.

00:52:35.018 --> 00:52:37.754
As a matter of fact, I don't
