00:52:39.456 --> 00:52:41.024
They're literally
not interested.

00:52:41.024 --> 00:52:42.359
They just get up and go to work.

00:52:42.359 --> 00:52:44.494 align:start size:81% position:19%
And then I started
thinking about

00:52:44.494 --> 00:52:49.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
