00:52:59.876 --> 00:53:01.545
a chisel to it or something,

00:53:01.545 --> 00:53:05.148 align:start size:84% position:16%
you better have your
relationship figured
out with danger.

00:53:05.148 --> 00:53:08.618
And also what things,

00:53:08.618 --> 00:53:11.321 align:start size:97% position:3%
so when you work construction
and you work carpentry,

00:53:11.321 --> 00:53:14.391
you have to pick up a tool and
