00:53:15.859 --> 00:53:18.662 align:start size:97% position:3%
but you have to use it in
such a way where you're safe,

00:53:18.662 --> 00:53:20.430
but you still have
to get the job done.

00:53:20.430 --> 00:53:23.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so there's a constant
calibration going on,

00:53:23.600 --> 00:53:26.469
